        "TileImage": "$($repository 04387b7a-25fa-4dec-baa0-eeff1d36ab11).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Today is a bit of a strange situation. Do you remember our bank robber clients? They are currently in a secret meeting, where we are not called. I have hacked their phones, and from them I have learned that they are planning to destroy the ICA, and rob us. So we have to eliminate two targets, who will be attenting the meeting. i couldnt identity them, but we&apos;ll call them by: The constant, and Constantin. We also want their elimination to be kept secret, so check the objectives.",
